  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the toxic runoff pits of Subchain City, 'Rotten' Frankie survived by scavenging parts and hustling for scraps. He saw firsthand how the flocks turned on each other for a single drop of DRIP, and vowed to become a legend, known for his grit and ruthless survival. Now, he wanders the wastelands, searching for valuable tech and DRIP stashes.",
    "class": "Wasteland Scavenger",
    "name": "'Rotten' Frankie",
    "personality": "Cynical, resourceful, and fiercely independent. Frankie distrusts most ducks, preferring the solitude of the wastes. He's a keen observer, able to quickly assess a situation and exploit any weakness. When he does talk, his words are dripping with sardonic wit and hard-earned wisdom.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Frankie can identify and immediately loot a hidden cache of DRIP or unique item within a 10-meter radius. He can use twice per battle, representing his scavenger instincts and accumulated knowledge of Subchain City's hiding spots.",
